; Exports of EEWebRasterizer.dll: the four plain C entry points the engine resolves with
; GetProcAddress in PIMModule::GetModule (and RPIMGetRasterizer in GEInitialize).  All are
; cdecl.  Ordinals are numbered alphabetically from 1, as the linker did for the original's
; plain exports (which sit at 252..255 behind its 251 mangled class exports).  The names are
; exported undecorated: the linker maps `PIMGetName` to the cdecl symbol `_PIMGetName`.
LIBRARY EEWebRasterizer
EXPORTS
    PIMGetName          @1
    PIMGetType          @2
    PIMIsValid          @3
    RPIMGetRasterizer   @4
